  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 200C, fan-forced. Coarsely chop the tomato. Thinly slice the spring onion. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves. Slice the haloumi. Combine the garlic, South American seasoning and 2 tsp olive oil in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the haloumi and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248564/photos/large/pickle_onion-228f1945d7ef2e51aa1ef6c9fa91d9e7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm pita: Halve the pita to form 4 pockets, put in a single layer on an oven tray and cover with foil. Heat in the oven for 10 mins or until softened and warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248565/photos/large/warm_pitas-bf2c82e293387f971f094b514c0a2739.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make salad: Meanwhile, combine 2 tsp olive oil, 2 tsp red wine vinegar and 1 tsp sugar in a large bowl. Add the tomato, spring onion and spinach and toss to combine. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248566/photos/large/prep_ingredients-67f165ccfc555285db5e8bb219322b23.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook haloumi: Heat a medium frypan over medium-high heat. Cook the haloumi for 2 mins each side or until golden. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248567/photos/large/cook_pork-24f2ad8d03b6dd9cb61ed9da8aae83ed.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Gently open the pita pockets, then spread with the mayonnaise. Fill with the haloumi and some salad. Serve with the remaining salad and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248568/photos/large/serve_up-c83d9e6696b317c968f1e73375d5087f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it herby: If you have some on hand, add coriander or parsley leaves to your pita for a burst of freshness.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2248569/photos/large/make_it_yours-f339d80a196a993be9a704c302d6b798.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
